## Derivation (design §1.4, calibration 1,000 credits ≈ $1.00)
  wIn/wOut  = {input,output}PricePerMToken × 1000   (fetchPricing, live API)
  wCache    = cacheReadPricePerMToken × 1000        (Nova Pro/Lite only; qwen/kimi = null)

