All 4 sources = live-api (SNAPSHOT_ONLY_MODELS empty — no snapshot fallback used).
NOTE (float normalization): fetchPricing returns per-1M as per-1K × 1000 in binary floats
(e.g. 0.060000000000000005 → ×1000 = 60.00000000000001). Committed seed carries the exact
decimal weights (60, 240, 140) — raw values verbatim below. Derivation remains
weight = pricePerMToken × 1000 on the exact decimal prices ($0.06/1M × 1000 = 60).
NOTE (cache writes): Pricing API confirms Nova Pro/Lite cache-WRITE dims price = $0.00 —
validates metering formula charging only cacheRead × wCache (no cache-write term).

